    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>亲历灵异事件后，我悟出了中式恐怖的本质。</span></p><p><span>听我说完，保证你再也不怕鬼。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="315">00:05:15</a> &nbsp;“鬼”到底是什么？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="615">00:10:15</a> &nbsp;从妖精修炼，道家“尸解”，到赛博“太阴炼形”。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1861">00:31:01</a> &nbsp;童年隔壁班，消失的双胞胎，葬礼上传闻中的猫脸“阴煞”。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2060">00:34:20</a> &nbsp;“魔”从哪里来？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2540">00:42:20</a> &nbsp;野生佛教徒的基本特点。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2668">00:44:28</a> &nbsp;那段时间，我怀疑世界不是连续的。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3205">00:53:25</a> &nbsp;庄子说，死后鬼的世界，和和美美的。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3620">01:00:20</a> &nbsp;小时候我们看到的怪物，到底是什么东西？</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6486f1d099c7dee86c5bc43f/lifOwWkojE-K5hH2lWFGHljAtD1Y.m4a" length="63206900" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:05:04</itunes:duration>
