    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>审美降级，每代人都喊过。</span></p><span></span><p><span>刷屏背后，是全人类面对新事物的本能焦虑。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="186">00:03:06</a> 怀旧=现在审美降级吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1238">00:20:38</a> 经典审美，是写在基因里的本能</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1910">00:31:50</a> 艺术的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3098">00:51:38</a> 相机出现，绘画出现了印象派；AI出现，老手艺会走向何方？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3562">00:59:22</a> 一代人有一代人的降级</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lkpWvaF_Gu9JbA6YxIXbiAFSqc39.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>内巴蒙花园</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlkuNMAUzdi8_qqOQSklbrck6Z17.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>古埃及壁画</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrVwznpMR3VIhAa8k7cHLd3npo-h.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>短缩法</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lpyD-H6H5otSPu-M1MwB9CKXC78C.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>从十字架放下的耶稣</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg-bWYHvio6_dbquP_-jsNtq0GLp.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>宫娥</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkTh7FSJg4pXYJPUnCI1OVso3R35.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>藻鱼图局部</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnd0j8ur8x_KQj35uUlnf1T_oozt.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>对月图</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlXhguZMtr1_n0u3RA9tJHtg5d8f.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>洛可可时期代表作</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvM1XEqPen7WgLeGdHRhj4ewGTB8.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>暴风雪中的汽船</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj2RH6Hqr_eRNlVgMP4OBHM1jLqD.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>巨人</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lru7fip55E_tfZx3PseKS42SqQNK.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>拾穗者</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnRYzupOn4wyY72IOdGEDr2OvIoz.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>日出</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvHE6Q77kDknL-6GoAxgbdB6UnRK.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>清晨的意大利街道</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lr5PUg32r9mRldh6ukr6ju0VdwwR.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>星夜</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjerN5_CYWwxTmgxn5Ogibr8ncZy.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>尖叫</span></p>]]></description>
